      "skos:note": "Conditional commencement of Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sec-2-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Schedules 1",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 6,
      "values:originalText": "and 2\nAt the same time as the Australian Centre\nfor Disease Control Act 2025 commences.\nHowever, the provisions do not commence\nat all if that Act does not commence."
    },
