      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “Director of Human Biosecurity may, in writing, determine that a\nhuman disease is a listed human disease if the Director”, substitute\n“Director-General of the CDC may, in writing, determine that a human\ndisease is a listed human disease if the Director-General”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “Director of Human Biosecurity may, in writing, determine that a\nhuman disease is a listed human disease if the Director”, substitute\n“Director-General of the CDC may, in writing, determine that a human\ndisease is a listed human disease if the Director-General”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b450f6b10c3e05c0747250231cb88107bfda8fb6191eed27218c77a98537c49",
      "skos:note": "Omitting a provision that allows the Director-General to determine listed human diseases."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Subsection 42(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Omit “Director of Human Biosecurity may, in writing, determine that a\nhuman disease is a listed human disease if the Director”, substitute\n“Director-General of the CDC may, in writing, determine that a human\ndisease is a listed human disease if the Director-General”."
    },
