    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-544a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "544A(3) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, the Director of Human Biosecurity must not delegate the\nDirector’s functions or powers under any of the following\nprovisions:\n(a) section 113 (human health response zones);\n(b) section 570 (issuing identity cards);\n(c) section 618 (declared movements)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-3-norm",
