      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) However, the Director of Human Biosecurity must not delegate...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the Director’s functions or powers under any of the following provisions:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "544A(4) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function\nor power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control\norders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in\nthe Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function\nor power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control\norders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in\nthe Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e0cc68ac7d4b59b809c1fc91853c7e0e8c7d643bcbcd307e3261987836d43771",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of Director's functions or powers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "544A(4) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function\nor power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control\norders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in\nthe Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4"
      },
