      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "544A(5) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which\nsubsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power\nunder section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if\nthe human biosecurity officer:\n(a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or\n(b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the\norder.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which\nsubsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power\nunder section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if\nthe human biosecurity officer:\n(a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or\n(b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the\norder.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5494257a6ac06dac6da5d43035bca280c39929a5cc4e1cea4b9b93b9ec26dac9",
      "skos:note": "Cannot perform function or exercise power under section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "544A(5) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which\nsubsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power\nunder section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if\nthe human biosecurity officer:\n(a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or\n(b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the\norder."
    },
    {
