      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAt and from the transition time, the Department of Health and Aged\nCare Enterprise Agreement has effect in relation to the Australian\nCentre for Disease Control as if:\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAt and from the transition time, the Department of Health and Aged\nCare Enterprise Agreement has effect in relation to the Australian\nCentre for Disease Control as if:\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f7b41206b98ecded56e16f56061730e815e9635d4ded44968aaf1fc760975dbd",
      "skos:note": "References in Enterprise Agreement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 References in Enterprise Agreement",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAt and from the transition time, the Department of Health and Aged\nCare Enterprise Agreement has effect in relation to the Australian\nCentre for Disease Control as if:\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-4-norm",
