    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of:\n(a) the old Biosecurity Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old Biosecurity Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary in the capacity of the\nDirector of Human Biosecurity.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply in relation to a determination made under\nsubsection 42(1) of the old Biosecurity Act.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity.",
      "skos:definition": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of:\n(a) the old Biosecurity Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old Biosecurity Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary in the capacity of the\nDirector of Human Biosecurity.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply in relation to a determination made under\nsubsection 42(1) of the old Biosecurity Act.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b40b0e28cf1880fbbd00a6633c763e730651aeefb359eb091e56ccca059e5ade",
      "skos:note": "Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer have effect as if done by the Health Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of:\n(a) the old Biosecurity Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old Biosecurity Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary in the capacity of the\nDirector of Human Biosecurity.\n(2)\nSubitem (1) does not apply in relation to a determination made under\nsubsection 42(1) of the old Biosecurity Act.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer, in the capacity of the Director\nof Human Biosecurity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
