      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Saving of identity cards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAn identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human\nbiosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act\nbefore the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued\nunder that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old\nBiosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be\napproved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of\nHuman Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new\nBiosecurity Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nAn identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human\nbiosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act\nbefore the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued\nunder that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old\nBiosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be\napproved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of\nHuman Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new\nBiosecurity Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a08d91234c7f17a8343220c167577409397508703c1bd6b819407fa19b48fbf3",
      "skos:note": "Saving of identity cards issued before transition time"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Saving of identity cards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nAn identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human\nbiosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act\nbefore the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued\nunder that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act.\n(2)\nIf, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old\nBiosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be\napproved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of\nHuman Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new\nBiosecurity Act.\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-7"
      },
