      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Transition time has passed.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Delegation was in force during the transition period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NHS Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NHS Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Health\nSecretary.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NHS Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NHS Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Health\nSecretary.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-11-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-11-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-11-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e917933271192fe1755c8c3d6aff05bca91ac0f5760f6b64b56a8687324ea2c",
      "skos:note": "Things done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary have effect as if done by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nHealth Secretary for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NHS Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NHS Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Health\nSecretary."
    },
    {
