      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12 References to the Health Secretary in instruments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-12"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to an instrument if:\n(a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition\ntime; and\n(c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary.\n(2)\nThe instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a\nreference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to\nthe Director-General of the CDC.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified instrument or a specified reference.\n(4)\nThis item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or\nrepealed after the commencement of this item.\n(5)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes:\n(a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and\n(b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the National Health Security Act 2007  Part 3\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025\n(c) an instrument made under the old NHS Act or regulations\nmade under the old NHS Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThis item applies to an instrument if:\n(a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition\ntime; and\n(c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary.\n(2)\nThe instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a\nreference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to\nthe Director-General of the CDC.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified instrument or a specified reference.\n(4)\nThis item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or\nrepealed after the commencement of this item.\n(5)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes:\n(a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and\n(b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the National Health Security Act 2007  Part 3\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025\n(c) an instrument made under the old NHS Act or regulations\nmade under the old NHS Act.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e54256165247ae5bab8a1518f21c3b8200a59c3722b015983cabd930f62cddc6",
      "skos:note": "References to the Health Secretary in instruments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 References to the Health Secretary in instruments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 38,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies to an instrument if:\n(a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition\ntime; and\n(c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary.\n(2)\nThe instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a\nreference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to\nthe Director-General of the CDC.\n(3)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified instrument or a specified reference.\n(4)\nThis item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or\nrepealed after the commencement of this item.\n(5)\nIn this item:\ninstrument includes:\n(a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and\n(b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and\n\nApplication, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2\nProvisions relating to the amendment of the National Health Security Act 2007  Part 3\nNo. 62, 2025\nAustralian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments\nand Transitional Provisions) Act 2025\n(c) an instrument made under the old NHS Act or regulations\nmade under the old NHS Act."
    },
    {
