      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
