      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) In this item: instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "before",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Transition time",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "ordered",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conditional commencement",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in relation to a specified instrument or a specified reference."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "doesNotPrevent",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Amendment provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) This item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or repealed after the commencement of this item."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
