      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) In this item: instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Legal proceedings involving the Health Secretary",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "If, immediately before the transition time, the Health Secretary was a\nparty to proceedings relating to the old NHS Act that were pending in\nany court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for\nthe Secretary as a party to the proceedings at and after that time.",
      "skos:definition": "If, immediately before the transition time, the Health Secretary was a\nparty to proceedings relating to the old NHS Act that were pending in\nany court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for\nthe Secretary as a party to the proceedings at and after that time.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-13-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "54e6a96a6e2af71704df2d840b1e0ac673efcf7c6696294c91bd7487964b6df9",
      "skos:note": "Substitution of Director-General for Secretary in pending proceedings"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Legal proceedings involving the Health Secretary",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "If, immediately before the transition time, the Health Secretary was a\nparty to proceedings relating to the old NHS Act that were pending in\nany court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for\nthe Secretary as a party to the proceedings at and after that time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-13-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-13"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14 Temporary additions to the National Notifiable Disease",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "List\nIf, immediately before the transition time:\n(a) a variation of the National Notifiable Disease List was in\nforce under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical\nOfficer;\nthen the variation has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had\nbeen made by the Director-General of the CDC.\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions",
      "skos:definition": "List\nIf, immediately before the transition time:\n(a) a variation of the National Notifiable Disease List was in\nforce under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical\nOfficer;\nthen the variation has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had\nbeen made by the Director-General of the CDC.\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c84e4fb8d55ebffbe1d5d822bae87d8ec9db484fddcdcd7805b82a7d005b901c",
      "skos:note": "Temporary additions to the National Notifiable Disease List have effect as if made by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14 Temporary additions to the National Notifiable Disease",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "List\nIf, immediately before the transition time:\n(a) a variation of the National Notifiable Disease List was in\nforce under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act; and\n(b) the variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical\nOfficer;\nthen the variation has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had\nbeen made by the Director-General of the CDC.\n\nSchedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasEffectAsIf",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes obligation on the Director-General of the CDC.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The variation has effect as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Specifies the temporal interval during which the variation has effect.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The transition time is specified in subsection 12(2) of the old NHS Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The variation has effect at and after the transition time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Specifies the temporal interval during which the variation has effect.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The transition time is specified in subsection 12(2) of the old NHS Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The variation has effect at and after the transition time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasEffectAsIf",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes obligation on the Director-General of the CDC to diffuse the variation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The variation has effect as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasEffectAsIf",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes obligation on the Director-General of the CDC to process the variation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The variation was made under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The variation has effect as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2025a00062.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2025a00062.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NORDR Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer.",
      "skos:definition": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NORDR Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a738401a90fe209eeb016efa4ade0794319dd3a92b119873a34acf793b31163c",
      "skos:note": "Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief have effect as if done by the Director-General of the CDC."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2025a00062#sch-2-sec-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "Medical Officer\n(1)\nIf, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of:\n(a) the old NORDR Act; or\n(b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act;\nthen the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been\ndone by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC.\n(2)\nThe transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in\nrelation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the\nCommonwealth Chief Medical Officer."
    },
